{"3690690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Infinite Loop:Backrooms", "steam_appid": 3690690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Backrooms! This is an alternate universe parallel to the real world. You’ve accidentally entered here, and now your only task is to leave!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains a large number of rooms. You need to navigate through various rooms to find the secret to leaving the Backrooms! In addition, the rooms contain numerous “entities,” “weapons,” “equipment,” “items,” “secrets,” and more! Be careful of the “entities” because they are very dangerous!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapon System:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can collect various weapon parts in the game and freely assemble them into unique weapons!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Gameplay:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game hides many secrets. Finding these secrets can lead you to the ultimate ending, enhance your survival abilities, or unlock secrets of other companions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes about 60 endings, but only leaving the Backrooms is the true ending!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Backrooms! This is an alternate universe parallel to the real world. You’ve accidentally entered here, and now your only task is to leave!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains a large number of rooms. You need to navigate through various rooms to find the secret to leaving the Backrooms! In addition, the rooms contain numerous “entities,” “weapons,” “equipment,” “items,” “secrets,” and more! Be careful of the “entities” because they are very dangerous!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapon System:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can collect various weapon parts in the game and freely assemble them into unique weapons!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Gameplay:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game hides many secrets. Finding these secrets can lead you to the ultimate ending, enhance your survival abilities, or unlock secrets of other companions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes about 60 endings, but only leaving the Backrooms is the true ending!</p>", "short_description": "This is an exploration + puzzle + mildly horror roguelike top-down shooter game where you can customize weapons and escape the backrooms through thousands of rooms!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean, Ukrainian, Turkish, Spanish - Latin America, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690690/277eefa115373124bddf2b942a9a7fc4f5a926d5/header.jpg?t=1786924008", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690690/c340c05a0ba23b58953528c30ae806b7d8b7f2dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786924008", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690690/c340c05a0ba23b58953528c30ae806b7d8b7f2dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786924008", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> win10/win11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700 or AMD FX 8320<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 or AMD Radeon R9 280<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</